# Support IQ: Deliverables

Support IQ is a telecom customer-support platform. Customers use a help center and a chat assistant. Staff use an
agent workspace for the live inbox, review queue, help articles and reports. The assistant answers from verified
sources only (help articles and resolved tickets), cites every step, and learns new fixes only after a person
approves them.

