### 1.3 What each block does

| Block | Technology | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| Help center | React pages (`frontend/src/site`) | Topics, articles and search, loaded live from the server |
| Chat widget | React + TanStack Query | Customer chat, Yes / Partly / No feedback, "Talk to a person", live agent replies |
| Agent workspace | React pages (`frontend/src/pages`) | Live inbox, cases, review queue, help articles, trending problems, issue types, reports, settings |
| Gateway | FastAPI | Public and staff endpoints, staff sign-in, routing to the pipeline |
| Handoff manager | `services/handoff.py` | Moves a chat between bot, waiting, agent and closed; the bot stays silent while an agent is in the chat |
| Scope check | `services/scope.py` | Greetings, off-topic questions (sorry message), requests for a person |
| NLU service | `services/classifier.py`, `entity_extractor.py`, `sentiment.py`, `memory.py` | Issue type with typo correction, entities, sentiment, severity, follow-up memory |
| Retrieval service | `services/retrieval.py`, `embeddings.py`, `reranker.py` | Hybrid search over help articles and resolved tickets, then re-ranking |
| Evidence score | `services/evidence.py` | Known / Uncertain / Unknown label for every answer |
| Generation service | `services/rag.py`, `grounded_templates.py`, `llm_provider.py` | Cited steps; uncited steps are removed |
| Customer wording | `services/wording.py` | Opening line and plain customer steps |
| Learning loop | `services/knowledge_evolution.py`, `emerging_issue.py` | Review queue, publishing articles, dataset rows, learned wording, trending problems |
| Data layer | SQLAlchemy, SQLite or PostgreSQL + pgvector | All stored records and the vector index |

